-        >>> it = ['too', 'many']
-        >>> one(it)  # doctest: +IGNORE_EXCEPTION_DETAIL
-        Traceback (most recent call last):
-        ...
-        ValueError: Expected exactly one item in iterable, but got 'too',
-        'many', and perhaps more.
